00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.305
- [Voiceover] Lucy asks,

00:01:38.305 --> 00:01:41.324
"At the age of 18, what's the
best way to approach a company

00:01:41.324 --> 00:01:43.576
"and ask for work experience?"

00:01:43.576 --> 00:01:45.511
