00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.297
that's twice the size of me.

00:09:16.297 --> 00:09:17.608
I'm walking.

00:09:17.608 --> 00:09:19.921
It's like eight minutes
after the bell rang,

00:09:19.921 --> 00:09:21.290
I'm lost as fuck

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.403
'cause we have huge high school,
I have do idea where I am.

00:09:23.403 --> 00:09:25.005
This is terrible, right.

00:09:25.005 --> 00:09:27.629
There's some dude, hanging out

00:09:27.629 --> 00:09:29.928
of class with Paige Parlow

00:09:29.928 --> 00:09:31.460
