school's over there."

00:09:41.862 --> 00:09:43.743
That's

00:09:43.743 --> 00:09:44.765
what happened to me.

00:09:44.765 --> 00:09:45.949
Do you know what I went through,

00:09:45.949 --> 00:09:46.855
what went through my mind?

00:09:46.855 --> 00:09:50.036
I said, wait till (beep)
(beep) (beep) face, punk.

00:09:50.036 --> 00:09:50.825
(laughs)

00:09:50.825 --> 00:09:51.963
Sorry, India.

00:09:51.963 --> 00:09:53.426
That's what went through my mind.

00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:56.630
And that's just where
I've always been. (laughs)

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.907
I know it was a little crude.

00:09:57.907 --> 00:09:59.486
- Gary Vaynerchuk, folks.

00:09:59.486 --> 00:10:00.948
(laugh)

00:10:00.948 --> 00:10:02.683
