00:10:02.683 --> 00:10:03.948
(laughs)

00:10:03.948 --> 00:10:05.796
- [India] From Allen.

00:10:05.796 --> 00:10:07.793
- India's blushing right now.

00:10:07.793 --> 00:10:10.300
- I am, but I blush all the time, so.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:11.554
- [Gary] Andrew's really blushing.

00:10:11.554 --> 00:10:13.504
- That was funny, I'm sorry.

00:10:13.504 --> 00:10:14.642
(laughs)

00:10:14.642 --> 00:10:15.955
- [Voiceover] Allen asks,

00:10:15.955 --> 00:10:18.845
"Casey, how will define if
Beme is a success or not,

00:10:18.845 --> 00:10:20.708
